# Copy to web/.env.local and fill in from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# Both are required: without them the app shows a "Supabase is not configured" screen.
# The anon key is public by design (row level security protects the data).
# Never put the service_role key, an LLM key or a Google client secret here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
